OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for illegal waste action
OL,4,Aafter site cleared
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP is urging the government to take
OL,7,Ftougher action against illegal waste
OL,8,Fdumping after one of England's largest
OL,9,Fsites was cleared.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency (EA) announced
OL,12,Fon Thursday that a 150m-long trail of
OL,13,Fwaste on land off the A34 near
OL,14,FKidlington, Oxfordshire, had been fully
OL,15,Fcleared.
OL,17,FMore than 22,000 tonnes of rubbish was
OL,18,Fremoved from the site during the
OL,19,Ffive-month operation, costing an
OL,20,Festimated #6m.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
